      <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground mt-1.5 leading-relaxed font-mono">
        Last updated: June 11, 2026
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="text-xs md:text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground space-y-6 font-sans">
      <p>
        Welcome to <strong>DevJSON Sandbox</strong>! These terms and conditions outline the rules and regulations for the use of DevJSON Sandbox's Website, located at <a href="https://devjsonsandbox.pages.dev" class="text-primary hover:underline">https://devjsonsandbox.pages.dev</a>.
