          <li>Republish material from DevJSON Sandbox without proper credit.</li>
          <li>Sell, rent, or sub-license material from DevJSON Sandbox.</li>
          <li>Reproduce, duplicate, or copy code templates from DevJSON Sandbox for commercial resale.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-base font-heading font-semibold text-foreground tracking-wide">
          2. Proper Use and Data Inputs
        </h2>
        <p>
          As an offline-first tool, all processing of your JSON payloads is done locally in your browser cache. You are solely responsible for the content you input. You must not use the tool to intentionally execute malicious browser exploits or test payloads designed to disrupt the page operations.
