      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-base font-heading font-semibold text-foreground tracking-wide">
          3. Disclaimer of Warranties ("As-Is" Clause)
        </h2>
        <p class="uppercase font-mono text-[11px] border border-border/80 p-3.5 bg-secondary/15 rounded text-card-foreground leading-normal">
