      </section>

      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-base font-heading font-semibold text-foreground tracking-wide">
          4. Limitation of Liability
        </h2>
        <p>
          In no event shall DevJSON Sandbox, nor any of its officers, directors, and employees, be held liable for anything arising out of or in any way connected with your use of this website whether such liability is under contract. DevJSON Sandbox, including its officers, directors, and employees shall not be held liable for any indirect, consequential, or special liability arising out of or in any way related to your use of this website.
